  "description": "WELL EQUIPPED with NEW XTL Brake Lever Technology: EXTRA Levers Mounted Left And Right Of Stem = Easier+Quicker Braking NORMALLY ~$120 to $150 UpCharge In Shops (See video below) Real Rider Quotes About XTL / Cross Top Levers: \"...on the bar top in traffic and hazardous situations and they really come in handy\" \"I love them. I'm really glad they came with the bike\" \" they're great. I have brakes at my fingertips no matter where my hands are\" \"...easier to apply when stopped with one leg off the bike\"\n\nSuperRoad - Dominate the Road: This Super Mirage SLX XTL Disc brake road bike can do it all. Endurance design means higher headtubes for a bit more upright and comfortable riding positions. Super wide range 24 gears conquers hills, Shimano Claris paddle shifting STI means easy braking/shifting in one place. Super Efficient, Genuine Shimano Claris drivetrain is rock solid for maximum power transfer with Front and Rear Disc-Brake hubs. Add in Fast Aero Rim wheelset, Lightweight Aluminum frame, Precision Bladed forks Well equipped with 700c Tires.\n\nComes with 32c tires, capable of using up to 700x40c* to dominate gravel roads. Or use a narrow 700x23c for maximum speed on your commute. Laugh and float over rough roads, chipseal and revel in your powerful disc brakes through virtually all weather conditions.\n\nPerfect for the sport to advanced level athlete wanting the performance of an aluminum frame, coupled with the comfort of a Bladed fork and dealing with a budget. This model has Compact cranks for hill-crushing performance at a lighter weight.",
